{"seq":1,"slug":"rebate-fraud-risk-model","title":"退税风险模型与骗税手法识别","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/export-tax-rebate-drawback-filing/risk-audit-recovery/rebate-fraud-risk-model","wordCount":3128,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"退税风险模型与骗税手法识别\">退税风险模型与骗税手法识别</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念-风险不是-有没有问题-而是-证据链哪一段接不上\">核心概念：风险不是「有没有问题」，而是「证据链哪一段接不上」</h2><p>出口退税的资金来自国库，每一笔申报本质上都是「先付后核」——税款先按企业申报退出，事后才由税务机关用疑点核实、函调、实地核查验证真实性。风险模型要解决的，就是把有限的事后核查人力，按<strong>单位核查成本能挽回的税款损失</strong>排序分配。</p>\n<p>判断一笔业务的风险，靠三组证据是否自洽：<strong>货物流</strong>（报关单、提单、运输单据）、<strong>票据流</strong>（购进凭证、出口发票）、<strong>资金流</strong>（收汇凭证、付款流水）。骗税与过失违规的分界正在于此——过失是某一环资料缺失或口径不符，骗税是把三条流设计成一个<strong>闭环的虚构</strong>。国家税务总局公告 2026 年第 5 号《出口业务增值税和消费税退（免）税管理办法》（<a href=\"https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/202602/content_7056762.htm\">国务院政策文件库</a>，2026 年 1 月 1 日施行）把二者写进两套不同后果：第三十二条对「疑点」允许补正后办理，第六十一条对「以假报出口等手段骗税」则追缴税款并处<strong>一倍以上五倍以下罚款</strong>。</p>\n<p>风险的量化是一个乘法结构：风险敞口等于<strong>暴露金额</strong>乘以<strong>该笔业务属于异常的概率</strong>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 笔申报的应退税额，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 由主体、货物、资金流、数据偏离四类画像决定。模型不直接输出「骗税」结论，只输出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的分档，把高分批次推给人工核查、低分批次放行进快审。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>敞口</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mtext>主体画像</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mtext>货物画像</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mtext>资金流画像</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mtext>数据偏离度</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{\\text{敞口}} = \\sum_{i} A_i \\cdot p_i, \\qquad p_i = f(\\text{主体画像}_i, \\text{货物画像}_i, \\text{资金流画像}_i, \\text{数据偏离度}_i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">敞口</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">主体画像</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">货物画像</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">资金流画像</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">数据偏离度</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[申报批次进入风控引擎] --&gt; B[主体画像: 管理类别 成立年限 法人关联]&#10;  A --&gt; C[货物画像: 退税率 品类 出口国 单价偏离]&#10;  A --&gt; D[资金画像: 收汇比例 收汇周期 付汇主体一致性]&#10;  A --&gt; E[数据偏离: 报关-发票-收汇三单偏差]&#10;  B --&gt; F[加权评分]&#10;  C --&gt; F&#10;  D --&gt; F&#10;  E --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt; G{风险分档}&#10;  G --&gt;|低分| H[快审通过]&#10;  G --&gt;|中分| I[疑点核实 补充资料]&#10;  G --&gt;|高分| J[暂不办理 并案函调或移送]\">flowchart TD\n  A[申报批次进入风控引擎] --&gt; B[主体画像: 管理类别 成立年限 法人关联]\n  A --&gt; C[货物画像: 退税率 品类 出口国 单价偏离]\n  A --&gt; D[资金画像: 收汇比例 收汇周期 付汇主体一致性]\n  A --&gt; E[数据偏离: 报关-发票-收汇三单偏差]\n  B --&gt; F[加权评分]\n  C --&gt; F\n  D --&gt; F\n  E --&gt; F\n  F --&gt; G{风险分档}\n  G --&gt;|低分| H[快审通过]\n  G --&gt;|中分| I[疑点核实 补充资料]\n  G --&gt;|高分| J[暂不办理 并案函调或移送]</pre><p>四个维度各自的制度抓手不同：主体维度用<strong>管理类别</strong>与实地核查（第五十二条），货物维度用疑点核实（第三十二条）盯「低退税率货物按高退税率申报」，资金维度用第四十八条收汇期限与第四十九条收汇材料报送，单证维度直接对照第五十七条十二类情形。</p>\n<h2 id=\"骗税手法谱系与它留下的数据指纹\">骗税手法谱系与它留下的数据指纹</h2><p>骗税手法看似花样翻新，但每一种都在数据上留下<strong>结构性的不合常理</strong>——这正是可建模的入口。制度已把十二类异常出口业务直接写进<strong>第五十七条</strong>（依据财政部、税务总局公告 2026 年第 11 号第七条第一项），落入其中的一律<strong>适用增值税征税政策</strong>，不再享受退税。十二类可归为四组：<strong>购进凭证虚假</strong>（第一至四项，虚开或伪造专用发票、票面货物或金额与实际不符）；<strong>时间与主体错位</strong>（第五、六项，报关单出口日期早于供货方发货，或报关单货物与购进凭证不符——货物不可能「先出关后生产」）；<strong>生产能力不匹配</strong>（第八至十一项，没有相应产线却大批量出口或开票）；<strong>报关单来源不实</strong>（第十二项，将他人出口的货物虚构为本企业出口）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>手法</th>\n<th>通俗叫法</th>\n<th>数据指纹</th>\n<th>对应第五十七条</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>无真实采购、买进项票</td>\n<td>买单配票</td>\n<td>供货方集中度高、发票金额与产能不匹配</td>\n<td>(一)(二)(三)(十)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>虚构出口、他人货物挂名</td>\n<td>借货 / 假报出口</td>\n<td>报关单出口日早于发货日、单证主体分离</td>\n<td>(五)(六)(十二)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>同一批货反复出口</td>\n<td>循环出口</td>\n<td>同一报关单编号或同一货值高频重复</td>\n<td>(六)(十二)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无产线企业大批量出口</td>\n<td>空壳出口</td>\n<td>设备工具与出口品类不匹配</td>\n<td>(八)(九)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>低值高报或高值低报</td>\n<td>价格腾挪</td>\n<td>单价偏离行业基线、三单金额不符</td>\n<td>(三)(七)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无真实收汇、伪造水单</td>\n<td>虚假收汇</td>\n<td>收汇比例异常、付款人与收货人不一致</td>\n<td>第四十八至五十条</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"分类管理与-函调-这条跨省稽核链\">分类管理与「函调」这条跨省稽核链</h2><p>风险识别的落点是<strong>管理类别</strong>与<strong>跨地核查权</strong>两个机制。第四十九条规定，出口企业管理类别为<strong>四类</strong>的，申报时需报送收汇材料；次年 4 月 30 日后申报的，或曾被发现有收汇材料虚假、冒用行为且未满 24 个月的，同样需报送。管理类别越低，核查密度越高——它把「历史违规」折算成「未来审查强度」。</p>\n<p>跨境电商骗税里最难查的一环是<strong>供货方在异地</strong>：出口企业在本口岸申报，开票的供货企业可能在千里之外，口岸税务机关无法直接核实其产能与购销真实性。第五十三条给出解法——主管税务机关<strong>可以向供货企业主管税务机关发函调查</strong>，后者还可继续向<strong>上游企业</strong>发函，一条发票链由此可被逐级倒查直到查实某一环是虚开。</p>\n<p>核查触发后有三种强度递进的状态，理解其法律含义差别很大：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>状态</th>\n<th>触发条件</th>\n<th>后果</th>\n<th>条款</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>疑点核实</td>\n<td>审核发现疑点</td>\n<td>要求补资料核实，排除后照常办理</td>\n<td>第三十二条</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>暂不办理 / 暂扣</td>\n<td>涉嫌骗税或接受虚开被立案、涉嫌走私、低退税率货物按高退税申报、与进口国数据不符、函调发现供货方涉嫌虚开</td>\n<td>该笔暂不办，已办的暂扣其他已审核通过应退税款</td>\n<td>第三十三条</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>暂停办理</td>\n<td>非正常户、逾期未缴回应退税款、拒不配合核查</td>\n<td>暂停办理其出口退（免）税</td>\n<td>第三十四条</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>注意第三十三条的<strong>对碰维度已经跨境</strong>：报关单、出口发票、海运提单的内容与<strong>进口国家（地区）的进口报关数据不符</strong>也构成疑点。跨境电商普遍经第三方平台或海外仓销售，目的国清关数据与申报口径在归类与申报价值上的偏差，正成为新的高频触发点——这与<a href=\"../filing-system-reconciliation/three-way-data-reconciliation\">三单匹配与数据对账</a>是同一套数据，只是视角从「防错」转为「防伪」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"可落地的风险评分特征与模型结构\">可落地的风险评分特征与模型结构</h2><p>把上面的定性判断转成系统能跑的模型，需要的是<strong>一组可稳定计算的特征</strong>加上<strong>行业基线</strong>。最常用的三个：</p>\n<p><strong>换汇成本</strong>衡量每换回一美元收汇付出了多少人民币购进成本，长期显著高于行业均值意味着购进价虚高或用汇成本异常：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>换汇</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>人民币购进成本</mtext><mtext>美元收汇额</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{换汇}} = \\frac{\\text{人民币购进成本}}{\\text{美元收汇额}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">换汇</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">美元收汇额</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">人民币购进成本</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>退税率偏离度</strong>——第五十七条与第三十三条都把「低退税率货物按高退税率申报」列为重点，定义申报退税率与商品编码法定退税率的偏离，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>r</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta r &gt; 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 即异常，差额直接等于多退税款：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>申报</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>法定</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta r = r_{\\text{申报}} - r_{\\text{法定}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">申报</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">法定</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>三单偏差率</strong>衡量报关单、发票、收汇在金额、数量上的相对偏差，合理损溢之外需要分档容忍度（见<a href=\"../rebate-documents-evidence/rebate-document-evidence-chain\">出口单证与证据链</a>），否则模型会被大量正常贸易术语差异淹没：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>Q</mi><mtext>关</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mtext>票</mtext></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mtext>关</mtext></msub></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>M</mi><mtext>关</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>M</mi><mtext>收</mtext></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mtext>关</mtext></msub></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta = \\max\\left(\\frac{|Q_{\\text{关}} - Q_{\\text{票}}|}{Q_{\\text{关}}},\\, \\frac{|M_{\\text{关}} - M_{\\text{收}}|}{M_{\\text{关}}}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">关</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">关</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">票</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">关</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">关</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">收</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>评分模型采用<strong>规则引擎 + 统计基线 + 关联图谱</strong>三层叠加：规则引擎对第五十七条十二类做硬命中；统计基线把上述特征与同行业分位对比；关联图谱把企业、法人、地址、供货方、报关行、账户连成网络。图谱这层权重最高，因为虚开与买单配票的团伙特征不在单笔业务上，而在<strong>主体之间的关系</strong>——同一实际控制人的多家空壳出口企业、共用同一报关行、共用同一批供货方、资金在几个账户间循环回流。这类信号单看每笔都「正常」，只有把实体连成图，异常中心度才会显现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"被稽核时的应对顺序与证据自证\">被稽核时的应对顺序与证据自证</h2><p>一旦收到疑点通知、函调函件或《税务行政处罚决定书》，处置顺序错了会放大损失。正确的次序是<strong>先分清性质，再决定对抗还是补正</strong>：</p>\n<p><strong>第一步，判定触发条款。</strong> 对照第三十二、三十三、三十四、五十二条，判断是「疑点核实」（可补正）还是「暂不办理/立案」（性质升级）。同为「钱暂时拿不到」，前者补资料后仍可办理，后者可能演变为追缴，紧迫度完全不同。</p>\n<p><strong>第二步，按时间窗组织举证。</strong> 函调有答复时限，材料组织直接影响结论：以<strong>报关单为索引、其余单证为附件</strong>装订，让核查人员能沿一条线索走完全程。拒绝配合会落入第六十条「拒绝提供账簿凭证资料」的处理口径。\n<strong>第三步，自证真实性的三个锚点。</strong> <strong>产能证明</strong>（设备清单、用电用工记录、厂房租约）回应第（八）（九）项的产能质疑；<strong>资金回流排查</strong>证明采购付款流向供货方真实账户、无异常回流；<strong>收汇链完整</strong>要求境外平台回款记录与报关单按出口日期预勾稽。三项覆盖主体、单证、资金三个维度。</p>\n<p><strong>第四步，若属单证瑕疵而非骗税，走更正而非对抗。</strong> 第二十九条规定，发生销售折让、中止、退回或计税依据变化等情形，应在当月或次月<strong>负数冲减</strong>原申报；第三十条规定冲减后当期应退（免）税额为负数的，免抵退税企业结转下期抵减，免退税企业<strong>缴回税款</strong>；第三十五条规定已办理退税但未作负数冲减的，税务机关<strong>应当追回已退（免）税款</strong>。主动冲减是合规动作，事后追缴则可能叠加情节认定。</p>\n<p><strong>第五步，算清最坏情形的账。</strong> 若被认定骗税，成本不是「退回本金」，而是按第六十一条<strong>追缴税款并处一倍以上五倍以下罚款</strong>，并叠加<strong>停止出口退税权</strong>——停止期按骗取税款金额分档：不满 10 万元为半年至 1 年，10 万元至 50 万元为 1 年至 1 年半，50 万元至 500 万元为 1 年半至 2 年，500 万元以上为 2 年至 3 年。停止期内自营、委托、代理出口业务<strong>均不得申报退（免）税</strong>——对以退税为主要利润来源的出口企业几乎是停业级打击。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>退税风险的本质是三流（货物流、票据流、资金流）能否在<strong>同一批业务、同一组主体、同一段时间</strong>上自洽；模型把有限核查人力按风险敞口 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R=\\sum A_i p_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 排序。</li>\n<li>骗税与过失的分界在于<strong>是否为设计出来的闭环虚构</strong>：过失可依第三十二条补正，骗税依第六十一条追缴并处一至五倍罚款、停止退税权。</li>\n<li>办法<strong>第五十七条</strong>把十二类异常出口业务直接定为「适用征税政策」，可归纳为购进凭证虚假、时序与主体错位、产能不匹配、报关单来源不实四组，每组都有可计算的数据指纹。</li>\n<li>稽核强度由<strong>管理类别</strong>（第四十九条）调制，跨省核查由<strong>函调链</strong>（第五十三条）执行；疑点核实 / 暂不办理暂扣 / 暂停办理三种状态后果逐级加重。</li>\n<li>可落地特征以换汇成本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>换汇</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{换汇}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">换汇</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、退税率偏离 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span>、三单偏差率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span> 为骨架，配合规则引擎、同行统计基线与企业关联图谱三层加权；被覆盖时先依条款定性，属单证瑕疵的主动负数冲减（第二十九、三十、三十五条）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本篇建立在资格与凭证判断之上，判定框架见<a href=\"../rebate-eligibility-policy/rebate-eligibility-qualification\">出口退（免）税资格与适用范围</a>，风险模型所依赖的三单数据源见<a href=\"../filing-system-reconciliation/three-way-data-reconciliation\">三单匹配与数据对账</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"退税风险模型与骗税手法识别","id":"退税风险模型与骗税手法识别"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：风险不是「有没有问题」，而是「证据链哪一段接不上」","id":"核心概念-风险不是-有没有问题-而是-证据链哪一段接不上"},{"level":2,"text":"骗税手法谱系与它留下的数据指纹","id":"骗税手法谱系与它留下的数据指纹"},{"level":2,"text":"分类管理与「函调」这条跨省稽核链","id":"分类管理与-函调-这条跨省稽核链"},{"level":2,"text":"可落地的风险评分特征与模型结构","id":"可落地的风险评分特征与模型结构"},{"level":2,"text":"被稽核时的应对顺序与证据自证","id":"被稽核时的应对顺序与证据自证"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"申报疑点排查、表间校验与更正申报","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/export-tax-rebate-drawback-filing/filing-system-reconciliation/filing-exception-troubleshooting"},"next":{"title":"税务稽核、函调核查与退税审核机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/export-tax-rebate-drawback-filing/risk-audit-recovery/tax-audit-investigation-mechanism"}}